            {
                "entry_id": "709ced2d-9eca-3209-9f91-cc034e9b7937",
                "word": "répartiteur",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "99158558-e814-40f6-8816-c0b150eaed97",
                        "entry_id": "709ced2d-9eca-3209-9f91-cc034e9b7937",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "répartiteurs"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "3b0b59f4-53de-4e3b-bcd8-7fcda59b7e69",
                        "entry_id": "709ced2d-9eca-3209-9f91-cc034e9b7937",
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "répartitrice"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cc8a915b-2bea-3c1a-b239-92a460a6ee4b",
                        "entry_id": "709ced2d-9eca-3209-9f91-cc034e9b7937",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Celui qui fait, qui est chargé de faire une répartition."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Administration"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "51485f90-6355-4ae0-a77c-492b9dfca9c3",
                                "sense_id": "cc8a915b-2bea-3c1a-b239-92a460a6ee4b",
                                "text": "D’une manière générale, les répartiteurs eux-mêmes sont issues des directions des C[omités généraux d']O[rganisation] (R. Carmichael est à la fois directeur du CO du Textile et répartiteur de la section des Textiles ; de même, Régis Ribes pour les Cuirs), ou issus des syndicats patronaux (Georges Perret, secrétaire-général du Syndicat du Caoutchouc, est répartiteur du caoutchouc), ou encore de grandes entreprises (Henri Fayol, répartiteur des Fontes, fers et aciers ; Jean Barbizet, répartiteur des Métaux non ferreux)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d14feba3-a6e0-4c62-a8c0-cde21a56c3b4",
                                "sense_id": "cc8a915b-2bea-3c1a-b239-92a460a6ee4b",
                                "text": "Ils ont également été en mesure de trouver quelqu’un, Éric Martel, qui avait un téléphone sur lui pour contacter les services d’urgence. Cela a permis aux sauveteurs d’entendre les instructions du répartiteur du 911."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1794c1de-e205-486a-ad6a-9496617fa454",
                                "sense_id": "cc8a915b-2bea-3c1a-b239-92a460a6ee4b",
                                "text": "— Allô ?\n — Ah, c'est toi Hervé, dit Victor, le répartiteur de la compagnie de taxis."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "29312cd0-d06e-324f-b793-ad8ad0fc4977",
                        "entry_id": "709ced2d-9eca-3209-9f91-cc034e9b7937",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Employé responsable du mouvement des produits."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Industrie pétrolière"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e41ca5d9-d1c7-4e2b-bb58-e6cbb4529ebe",
                        "source_entry_id": "709ced2d-9eca-3209-9f91-cc034e9b7937",
                        "target_lang_word": "dispatcher",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "dispatcher",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1ec2f1f6-d98d-3799-b935-3dd12921d89f",
                                        "entry_id": "35badc65-5793-30a7-8a74-1004c57bc93c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Agent noun of dispatch; one who dispatches."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "agent",
                                            "form-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "61eb5945-eee0-3f01-8a9a-292942e4cfe2",
                                        "entry_id": "35badc65-5793-30a7-8a74-1004c57bc93c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a transportation organization, a person who controls the movements of vehicles."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "018abffd-55d9-4ce0-861d-44475b7de182",
                                                "sense_id": "61eb5945-eee0-3f01-8a9a-292942e4cfe2",
                                                "text": "The organization of Decline to Sign involved trained teams sent out to where 608/610 supporters were gathering signatures, alerted by dispatchers operating a hotline to which anyone could call in—from a mall, the ferry terminals, holiday events, etc. when signature gatherers were sighted."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1faec7cb-04ca-33bd-bcd8-11e1d3e9b503",
                                        "entry_id": "35badc65-5793-30a7-8a74-1004c57bc93c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A piece of software responsible for assigning priorities and resources to tasks waiting to be scheduled."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8785c2a5-0b15-3e09-bf29-6d1c33514e4e",
                                        "entry_id": "35badc65-5793-30a7-8a74-1004c57bc93c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any die used for cheating, whether fraudulently weighted or bearing duplicate numbers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "43f930fb-1bd5-4e4d-90b4-017db463c37d",
                                                "sense_id": "8785c2a5-0b15-3e09-bf29-6d1c33514e4e",
                                                "text": "First see that each die has all six figures upon it, for some dice are dispatchers, made with double numbers, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee777b6a-d3ef-43f1-9e24-874af4d57429",
                                                "sense_id": "8785c2a5-0b15-3e09-bf29-6d1c33514e4e",
                                                "text": "He also knew, with another proficient glance, that the dice the youngster jiggled were likely a pair of dispatchers—so named because they effectively \"dispatched\" their intended targets: suckers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "44fc1fad-62f5-49df-a8db-dae2f96c3463",
                        "source_entry_id": "709ced2d-9eca-3209-9f91-cc034e9b7937",
                        "target_lang_word": "диспетчер",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "диспетчер",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "721751cb-f970-3a68-8375-867b5664f8b4",
                                        "entry_id": "b9874160-b224-34ff-8769-7c2a370cbf78",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "работник, регулирующий из центрального пункта ход работы предприятия, отдельных его звеньев и исполнителей, порядок движения транспорта, распределения заданий и ресурсов и т. п."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "caffe10b-78ac-4046-b671-acd31c86f31c",
                                                "sense_id": "721751cb-f970-3a68-8375-867b5664f8b4",
                                                "text": "Диспетчер передает экипажам самолетов необходимые команды, и те обязаны в точности исполнять их."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9c87313-ba47-466d-9da8-22e032c5ff95",
                                                "sense_id": "721751cb-f970-3a68-8375-867b5664f8b4",
                                                "text": "Всеми станциями управляет диспетчер, сидящий за диспетчерским пультом."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9da86017-07ef-47d1-89e0-17b04cfd0467",
                                                "sense_id": "721751cb-f970-3a68-8375-867b5664f8b4",
                                                "text": "Подходит, например, в порт на погрузку танкер, и диспетчер решает, пропустить его вперед или поставить в хвост очереди."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4a34e7e4-5596-30a2-81fb-3791bd23448a",
                                        "entry_id": "b9874160-b224-34ff-8769-7c2a370cbf78",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "неодуш., комп. программа, отвечающая за управление процессами в операционной системе"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c4efcd42-0748-4efb-b586-9fa252016f3f",
                                                "sense_id": "4a34e7e4-5596-30a2-81fb-3791bd23448a",
                                                "text": "Диспетчер задач (Task Manager), как гласит его имя, позволяет пользователю управлять задачами, выполняющимися на локальном компьютере."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
